WEBVTT

00:00:00.575 --> 00:00:01.245 line:85%
[chime: the sun lands]

00:00:01.325 --> 00:00:03.079 line:85%
Don't just send crypto…

00:00:03.159 --> 00:00:04.875 line:85%
make them play for it.

00:00:05.325 --> 00:00:06.906 line:85%
This is FLAT//RELAY.

00:00:06.986 --> 00:00:09.385 line:85%
$WIF gifts, on Robinhood Chain.

00:00:09.935 --> 00:00:11.088 line:85%
You pick an amount,

00:00:11.168 --> 00:00:12.602 line:85%
and how many people can claim.

00:00:12.682 --> 00:00:15.243 line:85%
It's locked in an escrow contract,

00:00:15.323 --> 00:00:18.235 line:85%
plus 1% on top that gets burned. For good.

00:00:19.723 --> 00:00:21.129 line:85%
You get a single link.

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:22.642 line:85%
Whoever has it can claim,

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:24.673 line:85%
so send it to people you like.

00:00:24.973 --> 00:00:27.811 line:85%
Your friend opens it,
and has to land the sun.

00:00:27.891 --> 00:00:30.103 line:85%
Three rounds, each one faster.

00:00:30.183 --> 00:00:32.543 line:85%
Not a gamer? There's a skip button.

00:00:33.868 --> 00:00:36.132 line:85%
Then they paste an address, and claim.

00:00:36.212 --> 00:00:37.721 line:85%
No gas money needed.

00:00:37.801 --> 00:00:39.322 line:85%
Our relayer pays the fee,

00:00:39.402 --> 00:00:42.118 line:85%
and the $WIF can only go to that address.

00:00:42.468 --> 00:00:44.928 line:85%
And here's the fun part. Pass it on!

00:00:45.008 --> 00:00:46.844 line:85%
One tap opens a new gift,

00:00:46.924 --> 00:00:48.078 line:85%
already filled in.

00:00:48.158 --> 00:00:50.468 line:85%
Fund it, and the relay keeps going.

00:00:50.548 --> 00:00:53.358 line:85%
Every new gift burns another 1%.

00:00:54.208 --> 00:00:57.241 line:85%
Senders can see exactly
where their gift travelled.

00:00:57.321 --> 00:01:00.708 line:85%
And every gift, claim and
burn is right there on chain.

00:01:01.158 --> 00:01:02.382 line:85%
Nobody claimed in time?

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:05.544 line:85%
After it expires,
the sender reclaims what's left.

00:01:05.624 --> 00:01:07.186 line:85%
The contract has no admin,

00:01:07.266 --> 00:01:09.058 line:85%
and it can't be upgraded.

00:01:09.508 --> 00:01:11.680 line:85%
Fund it. Share it. Play it…

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:12.931 line:85%
and pass it on.

00:01:13.011 --> 00:01:16.588 line:85%
Try it free, at flat-relay.vercel.app
